content:
For years, the worst part of being a designer wasn't the design — it was watching it die in handoff. 💀

You'd craft something beautiful, hand it to devs, and get back a sad 80%-accurate version of your vision.

@usewonder just killed that. What you design is the code. No translation, no loss.

And now they've put $10K behind it with one ask: build something wonderful.

@DannPetty @floguo @MarkKnd @contraben @aibek_design are watching. I'm in. Who's building with me? 👀
